1427
00:53:19,910 --> 00:53:21,140
Every move's deadly.

1428
00:53:24,400 --> 00:53:26,360
Churan's hand's
starting to shake a little.

1429
00:53:26,360 --> 00:53:27,480
I can't quite figure out

1430
00:53:27,480 --> 00:53:28,990
(Suddenly nervous)
this guy's strategy anymore.

1431
00:53:31,900 --> 00:53:33,460
(Double open three completed)

1432
00:53:33,480 --> 00:53:34,500
Game over!

1433
00:53:36,960 --> 00:53:37,520
Impressive.

1434
00:53:37,520 --> 00:53:39,000
Wait, how'd I win?

1435
00:53:39,000 --> 00:53:39,560
Hold on.

1436
00:53:39,560 --> 00:53:40,520
(How'd I win?)
Here and here.

1437
00:53:40,520 --> 00:53:41,840
You didn't even know you'd won!

1438
00:53:45,480 --> 00:53:46,560
But was I fast or what?

1439
00:53:46,560 --> 00:53:48,480
