Bai, do you always play that fast?

1440
00:53:48,480 --> 00:53:48,840
Nah.

1441
00:53:48,840 --> 00:53:50,000
I just played randomly.

1442
00:53:50,320 --> 00:53:51,280
Seriously?

1443
00:53:51,280 --> 00:53:53,120
I just put pieces
