1640
01:00:15,600 --> 01:00:16,200
Right?

1641
01:00:16,200 --> 01:00:16,710
Not bad.

1642
01:00:17,920 --> 01:00:19,000
We've made the shortlist over here.

1643
01:00:19,900 --> 01:00:21,000
