1645
01:00:21,900 --> 01:00:22,560
The shortlist's over here.

1646
01:00:22,560 --> 01:00:23,800
Shortlist area!

1647
01:00:23,800 --> 01:00:24,830
Then I'll...

1648
01:00:25,560 --> 01:00:27,470
