Everyone, please close your eyes.

2502
01:26:33,040 --> 01:26:34,940
All right, werewolves, open your eyes.

2503
01:26:36,020 --> 01:26:38,660
(Aphids This Round)

2504
01:26:39,240 --> 01:26:39,760
Who is going up?

2505
01:26:39,760 --> 01:26:40,240
I'll protect them.

2506
01:26:40,240 --> 01:26:40,960
Protect them.

2507
01:26:40,960 --> 01:26:41,320
I'll protect them.

2508
01:26:41,320 --> 01:26:42,400
I will go protect them.

2509
01:26:42,400 --> 01:26:43,200
(Taking the initiative)
Who is going up?

2510
01:26:43,280 --> 01:26:44,200
What about Jingyu?

2511
01:26:44,200 --> 01:26:45,050
I am not protecting anyone.

2512
01:26:46,400 --> 01:26:47,240
Who went up this time?

2513
01:26:47,240 --> 01:26:48,320
Is Churan here?

2514
01:26:48,320 --> 01:26:48,880
I am here.

2515
01:26:48,880 --> 01:26:50,120
I am behind you.

2516
01:26:50,120 --> 01:26:50,400
Okay.

2517
01:26:50,400 --> 01:26:51,480
You are going up there, right?

2518
01:26:51,480 --> 01:26:52,320
My eyes are closed.

2519
01:26:52,320 --> 01:26:52,680
I'll protect you.

2520
01:26:52,680 --> 01:26:53,200
Bai, are you going up?

2521
01:26:53,200 --> 01:26:53,600
Protect me.

2522
01:26:53,600 --> 01:26:54,040
My eyes are closed.

2523
01:26:54,040 --> 01:26:54,880
Have you opened yours?

2524
01:26:54,880 --> 01:26:55,880
Your eyes are closed, but mine are open.

2525
01:26:55,880 --> 01:26:57,460
(What is going on here?)
Wait, who has their eyes open now?

2526
01:27:06,920 --> 01:27:08,640
Then I will volunteer.

2527
01:27:08,640 --> 01:27:09,080
Go ahead.

2528
01:27:09,080 --> 01:27:09,900
I am going up.

2529
01:27:15,240 --> 01:27:16,060
You startled me.

2530
01:27:16,220 --> 01:27:18,020
(Your trusted protector is back)

2531
01:27:18,060 --> 01:27:19,980
(Hunting time)

2532
01:27:21,160 --> 01:27:21,880
It is over.

2533
01:27:21,880 --> 01:27:23,700
Bai.

2534
01:27:23,980 --> 01:27:25,620
(Wang Churan out)

2535
01:27:25,640 --> 01:27:26,840
Bai.

2536
01:27:26,920 --> 01:27:27,800
Call the police.

2537
01:27:27,800 --> 01:27:28,660
Open your eyes.

2538
01:27:28,820 --> 01:27:30,220
(Bing opens his eyes first
and calls for help)

2539
01:27:36,760 --> 01:27:37,700
What are you doing?

2540
01:27:37,740 --> 01:27:38,620
(An imposing presence)

2541
01:27:38,640 --> 01:27:40,100
I am protecting the person
in front of me.

2542
01:27:40,100 --> 01:27:43,540
(Take a look at that positioning)

2543
01:27:43,580 --> 01:27:45,660
(Scapegoat target identified)

2544
01:27:45,680 --> 01:27:47,040
Does seeing your former colleague

2545
01:27:47,040 --> 01:27:47,920
up there

2546
01:27:47,920 --> 01:27:48,680
make you lose

2547
01:27:48,680 --> 01:27:50,380
your train of thought?

2548
01:27:51,240 --> 01:27:52,240
What are you doing up there?

2549
01:27:52,240 --> 01:27:53,240
I am trying to block the attack.

2550
01:27:53,240 --> 01:27:54,220
I thought I said...

2551
01:27:54,220 --> 01:27:55,620
(The ultimate human shield)

2552
01:27:55,640 --> 01:27:57,360
Didn't you say you would stop
protecting people this round?

2553
01:27:57,360 --> 01:27:58,820
Wasn't I supposed to mislead the others?

2554
01:28:02,600 --> 01:28:03,540
You did a good job of misleading them.

2555
01:28:03,540 --> 01:28:04,700
(He has misled everyone)

2556
01:28:06,640 --> 01:28:08,320
I thought you were doing
a dive routine over there.

2557
01:28:08,320 --> 01:28:09,680
I had no idea what you were doing.

2558
01:28:09,680 --> 01:28:11,440
You were even striking
bodybuilding poses.

2559
01:28:11,440 --> 01:28:12,000
You know?

2560
01:28:12,000 --> 01:28:13,440
You were doing something like this.

2561
01:28:13,520 --> 01:28:15,200
I had no idea
what you were trying to block.

2562
01:28:15,200 --> 01:28:17,240
When I could finally
see the world again,

2563
01:28:17,240 --> 01:28:19,380
all I saw was Huang Jingyu
grinning at me.

2564
01:28:20,520 --> 01:28:21,740
He was backlit by a bright light.

2565
01:28:21,940 --> 01:28:24,500
(Your trusted protector has arrived)

2566
01:28:25,780 --> 01:28:27,220
(Sir, please protect me)

2567
01:28:28,240 --> 01:28:31,120
No one could make sense
of your movements.

2568
01:28:31,120 --> 01:28:32,160
There is nothing we can do now.

2569
01:28:32,160 --> 01:28:33,440
Huang, we are voting you out first.

2570
01:28:33,440 --> 01:28:34,080
You are our only option.

2571
01:28:34,080 --> 01:28:34,920
No, you cannot do that.

2572
01:28:34,920 --> 01:28:35,200
No,

2573
01:28:35,200 --> 01:28:35,920
I...

2574
01:28:36,000 --> 01:28:36,380
I...

2575
01:28:36,380 --> 01:28:38,140
(Unable to explain himself)

2576
01:28:38,160 --> 01:28:38,520
Explain yourself.

2577
01:28:38,520 --> 01:28:39,420
Why were you standing there?

2578
01:28:39,420 --> 01:28:40,740
(Struggling to suppress a smile)

2579
01:28:40,920 --> 01:28:42,040
Besides blocking her light, what else

2580
01:28:42,040 --> 01:28:42,800
could you have blocked?

2581
01:28:42,800 --> 01:28:43,640
No...

2582
01:28:43,720 --> 01:28:45,160
I could block their line of sight.

2583
01:28:45,160 --> 01:28:45,760
You could block it?

2584
01:28:45,760 --> 01:28:47,720
Whose line of sight were you blocking?

2585
01:28:47,800 --> 01:28:49,340
I could not see anything
either, all right?

2586
01:28:50,360 --> 01:28:51,480
I felt my way over.

2587
01:28:51,480 --> 01:28:52,740
So you walked past them?

2588
01:28:56,600 --> 01:28:58,100
I am never protecting anyone again.

2589
01:28:58,100 --> 01:29:00,340
(The human shield
is officially out of service)

2590
01:29:00,720 --> 01:29:02,560
I will never go up there
to protect anyone again.

2591
01:29:02,560 --> 01:29:03,400
It really was not me.

2592
01:29:03,400 --> 01:29:05,900
You try to do something good,
and this is how you get treated.

2593
01:29:07,840 --> 01:29:09,000
It has to be one of those two.

2594
01:29:09,000 --> 01:29:09,740
Choose one.

2595
01:29:10,440 --> 01:29:11,380
How is that my problem?

2596
01:29:14,280 --> 01:29:16,020
Your behavior this round was...

2597
01:29:19,520 --> 01:29:20,320
He's suspicious.

2598
01:29:20,320 --> 01:29:22,420
I think keeping him in the game
is too risky.

2599
01:29:23,320 --> 01:29:25,480
Besides, it is extremely rare for Bai

2600
01:29:25,480 --> 01:29:26,360
to be this proactive.

2601
01:29:26,360 --> 01:29:26,720
Exactly.

2602
01:29:26,720 --> 01:29:27,960
(No longer an introvert)
He usually never takes the initiative.

2603
01:29:27,960 --> 01:29:29,760
He barely did anything
in the previous rounds.

2604
01:29:29,760 --> 01:29:31,940
But this time, he went up
with Churan in the very first round.

2605
01:29:33,120 --> 01:29:34,260
None of you went up.

2606
01:29:35,080 --> 01:29:36,920
When have you
ever worked as a protector?

2607
01:29:36,920 --> 01:29:37,280
We were just

2608
01:29:37,280 --> 01:29:39,080
discussing it here for ages.

2609
01:29:39,080 --> 01:29:40,240
I kept asking who had opened their eyes.

2610
01:29:40,240 --> 01:29:41,560
Otherwise, I would have gone up myself.

2611
01:29:41,640 --> 01:29:42,960
Did you open your eyes later?

2612
01:29:42,960 --> 01:29:44,040
(Calmly defending himself)
I didn't. She did.

2613
01:29:44,040 --> 01:29:44,840
She said she'd go up.

2614
01:29:44,840 --> 01:29:46,160
So I just stood there.

2615
01:29:46,160 --> 01:29:47,480
(Sneaks in a step)
Then he kept shouting,

2616
01:29:47,480 --> 01:29:48,280
Bai! Bai!

2617
01:29:48,280 --> 01:29:49,560
I had no idea what he wanted.

2618
01:29:49,560 --> 01:29:51,160
It seemed like

2619
01:29:51,240 --> 01:29:52,160
he thought my eyes were open

2620
01:29:52,160 --> 01:29:53,180
and wanted me to turn around.

2621
01:29:55,640 --> 01:29:57,520
Bai, do you still have
your eye-opening chance?

2622
01:29:57,520 --> 01:29:58,280
Yes.

2623
01:29:58,280 --> 01:29:58,960
I haven't opened my eyes.

2624
01:29:58,960 --> 01:29:59,960
Mr. Huang has his as well.

2625
01:29:59,960 --> 01:30:00,400
Yeah.

2626
01:30:00,560 --> 01:30:02,000
I say we vote for the one
facing us first.

2627
01:30:02,000 --> 01:30:03,060
Let's vote for him.

2628
01:30:03,140 --> 01:30:05,500
(No more teamwork?)

2629
01:30:05,680 --> 01:30:06,900
I wouldn't vote for either of them.

2630
01:30:07,580 --> 01:30:08,380
(Any bright ideas?)

2631
01:30:08,400 --> 01:30:09,800
Who should we vote for?

2632
01:30:09,800 --> 01:30:10,700
That's a tough call for me as well.

2633
01:30:10,700 --> 01:30:11,780
(So confidently said)

2634
01:30:14,760 --> 01:30:15,780
If I had to pick...

2635
01:30:16,520 --> 01:30:17,660
Well, if I had to...

2636
01:30:23,920 --> 01:30:25,020
I'd vote for Bing.

2637
01:30:25,020 --> 01:30:26,460
(Bing, who just called it?)

2638
01:30:26,480 --> 01:30:27,420
Can we sit down and talk?

2639
01:30:28,760 --> 01:30:30,520
Anyway, those two seem
the most suspicious.

2640
01:30:30,520 --> 01:30:31,380
Since...

2641
01:30:31,760 --> 01:30:33,460
I can't exactly raise my hand
to eliminate someone, can I?

2642
01:30:33,460 --> 01:30:36,860
(His former teammate is exhausted)

2643
01:30:36,940 --> 01:30:39,420
(My heart hurts)

2644
01:30:39,440 --> 01:30:40,560
I'll vouch for you if you vouch for me.

2645
01:30:40,560 --> 01:30:41,420
I'll vouch for you.

2646
01:30:43,540 --> 01:30:46,300
(Cheng's thoughts are
written all over his face)

2647
01:30:46,320 --> 01:30:46,900
Since...

2648
01:30:48,360 --> 01:30:49,000
He's a bit smarter.

2649
01:30:49,000 --> 01:30:50,020
Let's vote Bai out first.

2650
01:30:50,180 --> 01:30:51,580
(So much for their friendship)

2651
01:30:52,380 --> 01:30:54,140
(How sophisticated)

2652
01:30:54,280 --> 01:30:55,620
I don't think it's either of them.

2653
01:30:56,160 --> 01:30:57,460
That'd be way too obvious
for the Werewolf.

2654
01:30:58,200 --> 01:30:59,280
But seriously,

2655
01:30:59,280 --> 01:31:01,100
I think someone on the edge moved.

2656
01:31:01,100 --> 01:31:02,540
(Jia Bing and Bai Jingting:
Edge suspects)

2657
01:31:02,840 --> 01:31:04,520
(Afraid to move)
In Werewolf Kill, eliminate the edges first.

2658
01:31:04,600 --> 01:31:05,920
He must've done it from the side.

2659
01:31:05,920 --> 01:31:07,700
You mean Jia on the edge?

2660
01:31:09,520 --> 01:31:10,620
Or Bai on the edge?

2661
01:31:11,220 --> 01:31:12,780
(Pick a side)

2662
01:31:12,800 --> 01:31:14,420
But my gut tells me...

2663
01:31:14,780 --> 01:31:16,180
(Using something he doesn't have)

2664
01:31:16,200 --> 01:31:17,060
It's Bing.

2665
01:31:17,260 --> 01:31:19,060
(Pointing the finger at Jia Bing)

2666
01:31:19,080 --> 01:31:21,200
Look, Bing's gone all quiet again,

2667
01:31:21,200 --> 01:31:22,780
(The security bros are united)
acting like he's got nothing to hide.

2668
01:31:24,720 --> 01:31:25,920
I had these beads on.

2669
01:31:25,920 --> 01:31:27,080
(Rustling)
You'd hear them if I moved, right?

2670
01:31:27,240 --> 01:31:29,000
Why were you holding

2671
01:31:29,080 --> 01:31:30,020
those beads earlier?

2672
01:31:31,840 --> 01:31:33,340
You did it. You definitely did.

2673
01:31:34,160 --> 01:31:35,380
Now you're confessing.

2674
01:31:37,540 --> 01:31:39,780
(Confessing)

2675
01:31:39,820 --> 01:31:41,340
(You picked Jia's side,
so leave mine alone)

2676
01:31:43,060 --> 01:31:43,940
This is so hard.

2677
01:31:46,440 --> 01:31:47,420
The way you say it...

2678
01:31:48,240 --> 01:31:49,060
Sounds like an act.

2679
01:31:49,860 --> 01:31:51,580
(Catching strays)

2680
01:31:52,120 --> 01:31:52,740
So hard.

2681
01:31:53,560 --> 01:31:54,740
So fake.

2682
01:31:54,760 --> 01:31:56,400
Such an act.

2683
01:31:56,480 --> 01:31:57,480
He's not even acting.

2684
01:31:57,480 --> 01:31:58,580
He's just naturally dramatic.

2685
01:31:58,580 --> 01:31:59,980
(Just being fair)

2686
01:32:01,440 --> 01:32:02,860
I meant every word.

2687
01:32:03,740 --> 01:32:05,140
(He's got a point)

2688
01:32:05,320 --> 01:32:06,300
It's Chengcheng.

2689
01:32:07,400 --> 01:32:08,380
Vote for Fan Chengcheng.

2690
01:32:09,000 --> 01:32:09,640
Come on.

2691
01:32:09,640 --> 01:32:10,120
Three, two, one!

2692
01:32:10,120 --> 01:32:11,480
Bing's really going all out.

2693
01:32:11,480 --> 01:32:11,980
Time to vote.

2694
01:32:11,980 --> 01:32:13,521
(Fan Chengcheng*1, Bai Jingting*2,
Jia Bing*3, Abstained)

2695
01:32:13,521 --> 01:32:14,100
(Jia Bing eliminated)

2696
01:32:14,360 --> 01:32:16,200
Bing is eliminated.

2697
01:32:16,200 --> 01:32:17,580
The mission continues.

2698
01:32:18,980 --> 01:32:20,340
(Level 2 unlocked)

2699
01:32:20,360 --> 01:32:21,920
Everyone, close your eyes.

2700
01:32:21,920 --> 01:32:23,680
The mission continues.

2701
01:32:23,760 --> 01:32:24,040
I'll do it!

2702
01:32:24,040 --> 01:32:24,560
I'll go!

2703
01:32:24,560 --> 01:32:25,160
We need two people.

2704
01:32:25,160 --> 01:32:25,640
(Calling for a partner)
I'll go!

2705
01:32:25,640 --> 01:32:26,200
I'm getting up.

2706
01:32:27,540 --> 01:32:28,460
(Squinting, ready to strike)

2707
01:32:28,480 --> 01:32:29,040
I'm here.

2708
01:32:29,920 --> 01:32:30,400
I'm here.

2709
01:32:30,400 --> 01:32:32,120
I'll wait here for you.
I won't turn around.

2710
01:32:32,120 --> 01:32:32,680
Hurry up.

2711
01:32:32,880 --> 01:32:33,640
I'll come as well.

2712
01:32:41,240 --> 01:32:41,800
Hurry up.

2713
01:32:41,800 --> 01:32:42,460
(Aphid strikes)

2714
01:32:43,420 --> 01:32:44,700
(Dancing Grass paralyzed)

2715
01:32:46,560 --> 01:32:47,160
Wait a second!

2716
01:32:47,760 --> 01:32:48,320
Wait a second!

2717
01:32:51,860 --> 01:32:54,140
(Scrambling to find the source)

2718
01:32:54,180 --> 01:32:55,620
(Scanning the whole area)

2719
01:32:55,880 --> 01:32:56,480
I'm calling it.

2720
01:32:57,280 --> 01:32:58,320
Hu, did you open your eyes?

2721
01:33:00,800 --> 01:33:01,520
Who called it?

2722
01:33:09,440 --> 01:33:10,240
I called it!

2723
01:33:12,000 --> 01:33:13,320
Any cops on duty?

2724
01:33:13,320 --> 01:33:14,340
(Instant response)

2725
01:33:14,600 --> 01:33:15,160
Did you call it?

2726
01:33:15,160 --> 01:33:15,740
(The hunt begins)

2727
01:33:15,760 --> 01:33:17,600
(Dance Mission: 1/3, Aphid Eliminations: 1/7)
The moment I opened my eyes,

2728
01:33:17,600 --> 01:33:18,600
before they were even fully open,

2729
01:33:18,600 --> 01:33:19,400
I saw a foot right here.

2730
01:33:20,580 --> 01:33:23,300
(Fan Chengcheng's POV)

2731
01:33:23,560 --> 01:33:24,160
I'm calling it.

2732
01:33:26,520 --> 01:33:27,600
I'm off to do my mission.

2733
01:33:28,440 --> 01:33:29,320
You're doing a mission?

2734
01:33:29,320 --> 01:33:30,160
I'm doing my mission.

2735
01:33:30,160 --> 01:33:31,200
Hu and I will do it.

2736
01:33:31,200 --> 01:33:32,040
They said it needed two people.

2737
01:33:32,040 --> 01:33:32,920
I asked if Hu was going.

2738
01:33:32,920 --> 01:33:33,920
He went alone.

2739
01:33:33,920 --> 01:33:34,560
They said two people,

2740
01:33:34,560 --> 01:33:35,660
so I offered to join him.

2741
01:33:36,960 --> 01:33:38,440
When I opened my eyes,
I saw him coming over,

2742
01:33:38,440 --> 01:33:39,620
but his eyes were closed.

2743
01:33:39,940 --> 01:33:41,340
(Let's hear his side)

2744
01:33:43,200 --> 01:33:43,440
No!

2745
01:33:43,440 --> 01:33:44,680
I just...

2746
01:33:44,680 --> 01:33:46,100
I heard Chengcheng call it.

2747
01:33:47,240 --> 01:33:47,960
When I turned around,

2748
01:33:47,960 --> 01:33:49,260
you were doing this to him.

2749
01:33:53,040 --> 01:33:54,460
What are you even saying?

2750
01:33:54,460 --> 01:33:56,420
(Caught red-handed)

2751
01:33:58,860 --> 01:34:00,140
(Wang Anyu's POV)

2752
01:34:00,160 --> 01:34:01,220
I called it!

2753
01:34:08,360 --> 01:34:09,280
Then he started explaining.

2754
01:34:09,280 --> 01:34:10,000
You know?

2755
01:34:10,000 --> 01:34:11,200
I got a little carried away.

2756
01:34:11,340 --> 01:34:15,380
(Blinded by rage)

2757
01:34:15,760 --> 01:34:17,560
An impulsive kill.

2758
01:34:17,640 --> 01:34:19,340
Got a little carried away.

2759
01:34:20,100 --> 01:34:23,500
(Total defeat)

2760
01:34:25,760 --> 01:34:26,360
What's on your mind?

2761
01:34:26,360 --> 01:34:27,160
You're smiling to yourself.

2762
01:34:27,160 --> 01:34:28,560
Just remembering when we

2763
01:34:28,560 --> 01:34:29,600
went to the farm together.

2764
01:34:29,600 --> 01:34:31,160
We had so much fun with Lay's.

2765
01:34:31,160 --> 01:34:32,960
And Lay's is here with us
in Hainan as well.

2766
01:34:32,960 --> 01:34:35,360
Thin, crispy, and impossible to resist.

2767
01:34:35,360 --> 01:34:37,160
Keeping all the good stuff
to yourself, huh?

2768
01:34:37,160 --> 01:34:38,000
Of course not.

2769
01:34:38,000 --> 01:34:39,680
Lay's chips are too good

2770
01:34:39,680 --> 01:34:41,280
not to share. Here!

2771
01:34:41,280 --> 01:34:41,860
Dig in!

2772
01:34:46,120 --> 01:34:47,640
Next up,

2773
01:34:47,640 --> 01:34:50,200
our final adventure in Hainan

2774
01:34:50,200 --> 01:34:50,880
is surfing.

2775
01:34:51,440 --> 01:34:52,560
Let's go!

2776
01:35:00,800 --> 01:35:02,060
Here comes a wave.

2777
01:35:12,080 --> 01:35:12,840
Look at those waves.

2778
01:35:14,920 --> 01:35:16,200
Now that looks fun.

2779
01:35:17,120 --> 01:35:18,550
Meet our new friend,

2780
01:35:18,800 --> 01:35:20,330
"Shen Jingting."

2781
01:35:20,500 --> 01:35:22,660
(Copy and paste)

2782
01:35:22,680 --> 01:35:23,440
Hello.

2783
01:35:23,440 --> 01:35:24,240
After you, Teng.

2784
01:35:25,800 --> 01:35:27,080
Let me see you from behind.

2785
01:35:27,080 --> 01:35:28,560
Thought he was Bai, didn't you?

2786
01:35:28,560 --> 01:35:29,600
When you walked over,

2787
01:35:29,600 --> 01:35:31,120
I thought you were Bai.

2788
01:35:34,080 --> 01:35:34,720
Can you guys surf?

2789
01:35:35,120 --> 01:35:35,560
Nope.

2790
01:35:35,560 --> 01:35:36,400
How about you?

2791
01:35:36,400 --> 01:35:37,160
Nope.

2792
01:35:37,440 --> 01:35:38,480
I've stood up on a board before.

2793
01:35:38,820 --> 01:35:39,940
(You can surf?)

2794
01:35:40,360 --> 01:35:41,000
No, wait.

2795
01:35:41,000 --> 01:35:42,560
That was 30 years ago. Doesn't count.

2796
01:35:43,800 --> 01:35:45,200
No, but here's the thing.

2797
01:35:45,200 --> 01:35:47,480
If you only surf every few years,

2798
01:35:47,480 --> 01:35:48,080
you'll always

2799
01:35:48,920 --> 01:35:49,820
be stuck at the same level.

2800
01:35:50,120 --> 01:35:51,780
(Thanks for stating the obvious)
How long's it been since you last surfed?

2801
01:35:52,640 --> 01:35:54,000
Quite a few years, actually.

2802
01:35:54,000 --> 01:35:55,360
It was brand-new when I tried it.

2803
01:35:55,440 --> 01:35:56,580
Brand-new?

2804
01:35:57,960 --> 01:35:59,300
I don't remember the boards
being this big.

2805
01:35:59,300 --> 01:36:00,300
(Wait, what?)

2806
01:36:00,860 --> 01:36:02,100
(That was wakesurfing)

2807
01:36:02,100 --> 01:36:03,220
(Footage sourced online)

2808
01:36:07,660 --> 01:36:09,340
(My poor heart)

2809
01:36:09,900 --> 01:36:11,700
(Almost lunged forward to help)

2810
01:36:11,960 --> 01:36:13,440
That scared me.

2811
01:36:13,440 --> 01:36:14,640
Imagine coming all this way

2812
01:36:14,640 --> 01:36:16,640
just to wipe out like that.

2813
01:36:16,720 --> 01:36:17,460
How would I feel?

2814
01:36:18,960 --> 01:36:21,380
(My reaction be like)
You'd never live that down.

2815
01:36:21,760 --> 01:36:23,200
What a wipeout.

2816
01:36:23,200 --> 01:36:24,420
Come on, let's try it!

2817
01:36:24,960 --> 01:36:26,320
Is Churan joining us?

2818
01:36:26,320 --> 01:36:27,920
(Churan is sitting out with a sprained ankle)
Her ankle's swollen.

2819
01:36:27,920 --> 01:36:29,440
She'd better rest.

2820
01:36:29,440 --> 01:36:31,520
You can't come to the beach
without getting in the water.

2821
01:36:31,520 --> 01:36:34,320
And surfing is a must-try in Wanning.

2822
01:36:34,320 --> 01:36:35,640
Everyone should give it a go.

2823
01:36:35,640 --> 01:36:37,240
We also have different wave levels.

2824
01:36:37,240 --> 01:36:39,160
Anyu won Taobao's

2825
01:36:39,160 --> 01:36:40,480
Magic Magnifier in the game.

2826
01:36:40,560 --> 01:36:41,280
Okay.

2827
01:36:41,280 --> 01:36:43,200
Just say, I'm using my magnifier.

2828
01:36:43,200 --> 01:36:44,080
Make the waves bigger!

2829
01:36:44,080 --> 01:36:45,780
And the waves will get bigger.

2830
01:36:46,800 --> 01:36:48,640
(Some reward)
I'd rather make them smaller.

2831
01:36:48,640 --> 01:36:49,520
I'm telling you,

2832
01:36:49,520 --> 01:36:51,520
at this point in the show,

2833
01:36:51,520 --> 01:36:53,240
winning games doesn't even
earn you rewards anymore.

2834
01:36:53,240 --> 01:36:54,180
Just punishments.

2835
01:36:55,240 --> 01:36:56,100
Make the waves bigger!

2836
01:36:58,520 --> 01:37:00,400
Welcome to surfing in Wanning.

2837
01:37:00,400 --> 01:37:02,260
All right!

2838
01:37:03,100 --> 01:37:04,920
(Dahe)
I'll be your instructor.

2839
01:37:04,920 --> 01:37:06,360
My name's Dahe.

2840
01:37:06,360 --> 01:37:07,560
Dahe.

2841
01:37:07,560 --> 01:37:09,520
If you run into any trouble,

2842
01:37:09,520 --> 01:37:10,280
raise your hand

2843
01:37:10,280 --> 01:37:11,360
and shout my name, okay?

2844
01:37:11,360 --> 01:37:12,280
Dahe!

2845
01:37:12,360 --> 01:37:13,220
Da...

2846
01:37:14,200 --> 01:37:15,020
Da...

2847
01:37:16,080 --> 01:37:17,140
Take a big gulp!

2848
01:37:17,800 --> 01:37:19,520
I'll get to you

2849
01:37:19,520 --> 01:37:20,680
as fast as I can, okay?

2850
01:37:20,680 --> 01:37:22,140
Okay!

2851
01:37:22,490 --> 01:37:24,320
All right, let's learn

2852
01:37:24,320 --> 01:37:25,880
how to get on the board.

2853
01:37:25,880 --> 01:37:26,480
First,

2854
01:37:26,480 --> 01:37:28,760
place your chest on the board.

2855
01:37:28,760 --> 01:37:30,280
Then bring your legs up.

2856
01:37:30,280 --> 01:37:31,240
And you're on.

2857
01:37:31,240 --> 01:37:34,080
(Getting Up: Start lying face down)
Quickly place your hands by your ribs.

2858
01:37:34,080 --> 01:37:35,360
Lift your back foot

2859
01:37:35,360 --> 01:37:36,400
(3. Curl your toes over the tail)
and position it over the tail.

2860
01:37:36,400 --> 01:37:37,840
(1. Push your upper body up)
Up. Push yourself up first.

2861
01:37:37,840 --> 01:37:40,460
It's been ages since someone
bossed me around like this.

2862
01:37:40,960 --> 01:37:41,240
Right.

2863
01:37:41,240 --> 01:37:41,860
Okay, jump.

2864
01:37:41,860 --> 01:37:43,120
(2. Step your front foot between your hands,
plant it firmly, and bend your knee)

2865
01:37:43,120 --> 01:37:43,820
That's it!

2866
01:37:44,620 --> 01:37:45,820
(Nailed it in one go)

2867
01:37:45,840 --> 01:37:46,400
Good!

2868
01:37:46,560 --> 01:37:47,340
(1. Slide your back foot toward the tail)
Stand up.

2869
01:37:47,340 --> 01:37:48,179
(Keep your feet shoulder-width apart)
Turn your body sideways.

2870
01:37:48,179 --> 01:37:48,640
(in a lunge)
Turn your body sideways.

2871
01:37:48,640 --> 01:37:49,920
Make sure your front foot

2872
01:37:49,920 --> 01:37:51,820
stays behind the board's midpoint.

2873
01:37:51,820 --> 01:37:53,820
(2. Keep your front foot
behind the midpoint)

2874
01:37:53,840 --> 01:37:54,720
(3. Keep your weight centered)
Don't straighten your knees.

2875
01:37:54,720 --> 01:37:56,120
(Keep your knees bent)
Keep them bent.

2876
01:37:56,120 --> 01:37:57,440
One last question.

2877
01:37:57,440 --> 01:37:58,360
What if we fall in?

2878
01:37:58,360 --> 01:37:59,960
Dahe!

2879
01:38:00,840 --> 01:38:01,440
Once we...

2880
01:38:01,440 --> 01:38:02,120
once we get in,

2881
01:38:02,120 --> 01:38:02,420
you'll...

2882
01:38:05,040 --> 01:38:06,040
Have your hands full.

2883
01:38:06,040 --> 01:38:09,040
This might be the toughest day
of your career,

2884
01:38:09,040 --> 01:38:09,810
Dahe.

2885
01:38:10,480 --> 01:38:11,840
All right, does anyone

2886
01:38:11,840 --> 01:38:12,920
have any other questions?

2887
01:38:13,000 --> 01:38:13,560
Nope.

2888
01:38:13,560 --> 01:38:14,040
No more.

2889
01:38:14,040 --> 01:38:15,120
Okay, if you're ready,

2890
01:38:15,120 --> 01:38:16,120
you can head into the water.

2891
01:38:16,120 --> 01:38:17,160
I'm ready.

2892
01:38:17,160 --> 01:38:17,680
Let's go, Coach!

2893
01:38:18,280 --> 01:38:19,270
Do we go straight in from here?

2894
01:38:20,720 --> 01:38:21,540
It's so warm.

2895
01:38:21,540 --> 01:38:22,980
(Time to hit the waves)

2896
01:38:22,980 --> 01:38:26,620
(Filmed under professional
safety supervision)

2897
01:38:26,640 --> 01:38:28,200
This level of intensity...

2898
01:38:28,920 --> 01:38:30,180
There's an intensity level to this?

2899
01:38:31,640 --> 01:38:33,910
Bro, let's see how hard you|
can wipe me out.

2900
01:38:35,400 --> 01:38:36,800
Let's see who stands up

2901
01:38:36,800 --> 01:38:37,160
first.

2902
01:38:37,160 --> 01:38:37,520
Okay.

2903
01:38:40,360 --> 01:38:40,870
Not bad.

2904
01:38:41,140 --> 01:38:42,420
(No problem. I've surfed before)

2905
01:38:42,800 --> 01:38:44,000
Keep your eyes forward.

2906
01:38:44,000 --> 01:38:45,210
And watch the yellow line.

2907
01:38:46,900 --> 01:38:48,220
(Safety line: Get off your board here)

2908
01:38:48,340 --> 01:38:50,580
(Laser-focused)

2909
01:38:51,840 --> 01:38:52,960
What now?

2910
01:38:52,960 --> 01:38:54,080
Now we wait for a wave.

2911
01:38:54,080 --> 01:38:55,280
We just lie here?

2912
01:38:55,280 --> 01:38:56,920
(Surfing 101: Wait for a wave)
Yeah, we're waiting for one.

2913
01:38:56,920 --> 01:38:57,840
Right, just wait.

2914
01:38:57,840 --> 01:38:58,720
Wait for it to come.

2915
01:38:58,800 --> 01:39:00,560
Now let's try one from the front.

2916
01:39:00,860 --> 01:39:02,620
(First time surfing: Excited)

2917
01:39:04,060 --> 01:39:07,100
(Here comes a wave)

2918
01:39:07,440 --> 01:39:08,240
Come on, relax.

2919
01:39:08,240 --> 01:39:09,300
Let's find your balance first.

2920
01:39:09,300 --> 01:39:10,820
(Goggles on)

2921
01:39:10,860 --> 01:39:13,140
(Getting geared up)

2922
01:39:13,560 --> 01:39:14,080
Ready?

2923
01:39:14,080 --> 01:39:15,200
Eyes forward.

2924
01:39:15,200 --> 01:39:16,440
Three, two, one.

2925
01:39:16,440 --> 01:39:17,400
Push up.

2926
01:39:17,400 --> 01:39:18,000
Up.

2927
01:39:29,440 --> 01:39:30,360
What now?

2928
01:39:30,440 --> 01:39:31,860
(Missed his chance to stand)
Into the water!

2929
01:39:52,080 --> 01:39:52,840
I failed.

2930
01:39:54,860 --> 01:39:56,300
(All eyes on me)

2931
01:40:02,780 --> 01:40:07,180
(First to stand up: Fan Chengcheng,
AKA the Wave Rider)

2932
01:40:13,900 --> 01:40:15,540
♪Make them face reality♪

2933
01:40:15,620 --> 01:40:16,960
♪Make them face reality♪

2934
01:40:17,340 --> 01:40:18,520
♪Make them face reality♪

2935
01:40:18,700 --> 01:40:20,270
♪That's just how it is♪

2936
01:40:20,480 --> 01:40:22,030
♪That's just how it is♪

2937
01:40:24,740 --> 01:40:26,220
(Feels amazing)

2938
01:40:26,280 --> 01:40:27,150
Keep it real!

2939
01:40:28,440 --> 01:40:29,670
How'd it go?

2940
01:40:30,360 --> 01:40:31,520
I was flying out there!

2941
01:40:31,520 --> 01:40:32,400
I did it!

2942
01:40:32,400 --> 01:40:33,200
I was flying!

2943
01:40:33,200 --> 01:40:33,620
Chengcheng!

2944
01:40:34,780 --> 01:40:36,660
(Feeling the pressure)

2945
01:40:37,120 --> 01:40:38,200
Keep it real!

2946
01:40:38,740 --> 01:40:40,700
(Time to fight!)

2947
01:40:40,700 --> 01:40:43,020
(Filmed under professional
safety supervision)

2948
01:40:43,020 --> 01:40:44,520
(Here we go again!)

2949
01:40:44,520 --> 01:40:45,180
Ready?

2950
01:40:46,160 --> 01:40:47,400
Three, two, one.

2951
01:40:47,400 --> 01:40:47,920
Up.

2952
01:40:51,660 --> 01:40:53,940
(Hu nails it!)

2953
01:40:57,820 --> 01:41:00,860
(Shen Teng)

2954
01:41:10,120 --> 01:41:11,280
You stood up as well.

2955
01:41:11,280 --> 01:41:12,220
I sure did.

2956
01:41:12,860 --> 01:41:14,020
(Thumbs up)

2957
01:41:14,600 --> 01:41:15,600
A natural.

2958
01:41:15,600 --> 01:41:16,370
Easy!

2959
01:41:18,100 --> 01:41:20,460
(Why's this nothing like the surfing
I did years ago?)

2960
01:41:22,200 --> 01:41:23,140
You got this!

2961
01:41:42,000 --> 01:41:42,800
Nice!

2962
01:41:53,880 --> 01:41:54,600
Looking good!

2963
01:42:12,960 --> 01:42:14,040
Bing's doing great.

2964
01:42:16,040 --> 01:42:17,600
Big mistake picking a spot next to him.

2965
01:42:17,600 --> 01:42:18,290
Big mistake.

2966
01:42:26,640 --> 01:42:27,500
Too easy.

2967
01:42:27,500 --> 01:42:29,180
(Surfing? Piece of cake!)

2968
01:42:29,760 --> 01:42:31,680
Who's the worst besides us?

2969
01:42:32,840 --> 01:42:34,360
Besides us...

2970
01:42:35,200 --> 01:42:36,820
I don't think anyone else is that bad.

2971
01:42:36,820 --> 01:42:38,580
(Ouch, Teng! That hurts!)

2972
01:42:39,320 --> 01:42:39,750
Here it comes.

2973
01:42:40,520 --> 01:42:40,980
Let's go!

2974
01:42:46,340 --> 01:42:49,060
(The Old Teng and the Sea)

2975
01:42:53,480 --> 01:42:54,080
Teng.

2976
01:42:54,080 --> 01:42:55,980
(The ultimate jellyfish hairdo)

2977
01:43:01,340 --> 01:43:02,820
(Something's missing from his forehead)

2978
01:43:02,840 --> 01:43:04,110
Where's my gear?

2979
01:43:05,140 --> 01:43:07,140
(The essential gear)

2980
01:43:08,460 --> 01:43:10,460
("Shen Jingting" is back)

2981
01:43:10,720 --> 01:43:12,200
Never look back!

2982
01:43:12,260 --> 01:43:13,740
(You got this, Teng!)

2983
01:43:14,680 --> 01:43:15,140
Up!

2984
01:43:17,790 --> 01:43:21,920
♪Our youthful tears
won't be shed in vain♪

2985
01:43:23,400 --> 01:43:23,880
Up!

2986
01:43:24,720 --> 01:43:25,280
Up!

2987
01:43:25,920 --> 01:43:28,590
♪I'll hold on to it all my life♪

2988
01:43:30,210 --> 01:43:35,390
♪Young hearts will still tremble♪

2989
01:43:35,600 --> 01:43:36,020
Up!

2990
01:43:36,430 --> 01:43:40,310
♪No matter the storm,
we'll push ahead together♪

2991
01:43:40,520 --> 01:43:41,860
Spread your arms!

2992
01:43:47,250 --> 01:43:52,840
♪Never look back,
no matter how high the sky♪

2993
01:43:53,880 --> 01:43:59,910
♪Through sorrow and loneliness,
joy and wonder♪

2994
01:43:59,990 --> 01:44:02,610
♪I carry them all in my heart♪

2995
01:44:02,760 --> 01:44:08,530
♪Never look back,
no matter how long the road♪

2996
01:44:08,640 --> 01:44:10,000
Let's catch a big wave.

2997
01:44:11,120 --> 01:44:12,360
I'm using my magnifier.

2998
01:44:12,360 --> 01:44:13,260
Make the waves bigger.

2999
01:44:13,920 --> 01:44:14,730
Here it comes!

3000
01:44:15,560 --> 01:44:20,620
♪I'll embrace it all
and never look back♪

3001
01:44:20,640 --> 01:44:23,120
Seeing such beautiful scenery

3002
01:44:23,120 --> 01:44:23,920
makes me really happy.

3003
01:44:23,920 --> 01:44:25,520
I can't wait for the rest of the trip.

3004
01:44:31,280 --> 01:44:33,960
I hope the rest of our journey

3005
01:44:34,040 --> 01:44:36,120
is filled with fun

3006
01:44:36,120 --> 01:44:38,340
and unforgettable memories.

3007
01:44:39,040 --> 01:44:42,950
♪Let's see if our promises
stand the test of time♪

3008
01:44:43,800 --> 01:44:45,560
We've planted coral

3009
01:44:45,640 --> 01:44:46,760
and explored the rainforest.

3010
01:44:46,760 --> 01:44:50,120
We've done our part for Hainan's marine

3011
01:44:50,120 --> 01:44:50,720
ecosystem.

3012
01:44:52,320 --> 01:44:54,040
I hope everyone watching our show

3013
01:44:54,040 --> 01:44:55,720
lives life to the fullest

3014
01:44:55,720 --> 01:44:56,520
with all their energy.

3015
01:44:56,520 --> 01:44:57,680
May you find happiness

3016
01:44:57,680 --> 01:44:58,510
every single day.

3017
01:44:59,530 --> 01:45:01,440
Come visit Hainan in the summer

3018
01:45:01,440 --> 01:45:03,470
and enjoy its beautiful scenery.

3019
01:45:04,360 --> 01:45:05,880
Get close to nature, cherish it,

3020
01:45:05,880 --> 01:45:06,520
and protect it.

3021
01:45:06,520 --> 01:45:07,480
I love nature.

3022
01:45:07,560 --> 01:45:09,900
Embrace nature and experience
its beauty.

3023
01:45:10,980 --> 01:45:15,460
(From watching waves onshore
to chasing them at sea)

3024
01:45:15,480 --> 01:45:18,200
I'm so happy to be part of this family.

3025
01:45:18,200 --> 01:45:18,850
All the guys

3026
01:45:18,850 --> 01:45:19,970
have taken such good care of me.

3027
01:45:21,280 --> 01:45:21,880
Being surrounded

3028
01:45:21,880 --> 01:45:23,440
by nature has been so healing.

3029
01:45:23,440 --> 01:45:27,020
(The waves keep coming back)

3030
01:45:27,020 --> 01:45:32,940
(Just as we keep finding our way
back to each other)

3031
01:46:36,180 --> 01:46:37,100
(Situational Dialogue Chain Game)

3032
01:46:37,160 --> 01:46:38,800
(Next episode)
Since you already told me,

3033
01:46:38,800 --> 01:46:40,000
then what exactly did you do wrong?

3034
01:46:40,120 --> 01:46:41,480
Can you let me get a word in?

3035
01:46:41,480 --> 01:46:42,120
Go ahead!

3036
01:46:42,120 --> 01:46:43,240
You can't even say it, can you?

3037
01:46:43,240 --> 01:46:43,920
Just...

3038
01:46:43,920 --> 01:46:45,000
Get out of my sight.

3039
01:46:45,000 --> 01:46:46,020
And think about what you've done.

3040
01:46:47,120 --> 01:46:48,800
(Hint)
Wait, there's an AABB pattern in there.

3041
01:46:49,000 --> 01:46:51,140
Think about what you did wrong, wrong!

3042
01:46:51,380 --> 01:46:52,520
Two-Finger Chase.

3043
01:46:52,520 --> 01:46:54,680
Keep two fingers touching
the surface at all times.

3044
01:46:54,680 --> 01:46:56,120
Lift them, and you're eliminated.

3045
01:46:56,120 --> 01:46:56,960
I'll move over here.

3046
01:46:56,960 --> 01:46:57,760
Away from him.

3047
01:46:58,000 --> 01:46:59,650
You think you're safe over there?

3048
01:47:01,320 --> 01:47:03,040
(Aquarius, choose your safe haven)
So I'm the easier target, huh?

3049
01:47:03,040 --> 01:47:03,840
Let's take him down together.

3050
01:47:03,840 --> 01:47:04,480
We're both from Shandong.

3051
01:47:04,480 --> 01:47:05,800
Let's knock this Beijing boy out.

3052
01:47:05,800 --> 01:47:06,880
Why do we have to play like this?

3053
01:47:06,880 --> 01:47:07,840
While he's vulnerable.

3054
01:47:07,840 --> 01:47:08,640
Let's gang up on him.

3055
01:47:08,640 --> 01:47:10,040
Now's our chance, guys!

3056
01:47:10,040 --> 01:47:11,640
You finally figured it out!

3057
01:47:11,640 --> 01:47:12,400
Hold on.

3058
01:47:12,400 --> 01:47:13,520
While I'm vulnerable?

3059
01:47:13,520 --> 01:47:14,830
I'll take Anyu out first.

3060
01:47:15,840 --> 01:47:16,880
That was so smooth.

3061
01:47:16,940 --> 01:47:19,760
Anyu went right back where he came from!

3062
01:47:19,880 --> 01:47:20,620
Now's the time.

3063
01:47:23,260 --> 01:47:24,180
(I'm outta here)

3064
01:47:28,200 --> 01:47:29,110
How about we team up first?

3065
01:47:29,760 --> 01:47:30,800
A real man...

3066
01:47:30,880 --> 01:47:31,710
Knows when to back down.

3067
01:47:32,720 --> 01:47:34,200
You kinda look like
the Silver Horned King.

3068
01:47:34,200 --> 01:47:35,480
That's exactly what you look like.

3069
01:47:35,480 --> 01:47:36,720
(Definitely Mr. Huang)
Mr. Huang.

3070
01:47:36,800 --> 01:47:38,340
(The village gossip duo)
You look just like a gossiping auntie.

3071
01:47:40,080 --> 01:47:42,160
Looks like I've got
instant noodles on my head.

3072
01:47:42,240 --> 01:47:43,480
You kinda look like Zhang Qiang.

3073
01:47:43,480 --> 01:47:44,600
(Let me tell you, baby)
I said, Babe.

3074
01:47:45,640 --> 01:47:46,720
Zhang Qiang!

3075
01:47:47,800 --> 01:47:48,980
(Nervous)
Wait, hold on.

3076
01:47:50,580 --> 01:47:51,700
(Ouch)

3077
01:47:53,480 --> 01:47:55,280
Line up properly, everyone.

3078
01:47:55,280 --> 01:47:56,000
Don't skip turns.

3079
01:47:56,000 --> 01:47:56,610
Or there won't be anyone left.

3080
01:47:59,840 --> 01:48:00,450
Hit me.

3081
01:48:00,540 --> 01:48:01,560
(A bet's a bet)

3082
01:48:01,560 --> 01:48:02,680
How can you expect me

3083
01:48:02,680 --> 01:48:03,680
to hit a girl that hard?

3084
01:48:07,140 --> 01:48:07,780
(Ahh)

3085
01:48:08,340 --> 01:48:08,940
(Ahh)

3086
01:48:09,440 --> 01:48:10,600
One more round!

3087
01:48:10,680 --> 01:48:11,590
One more round!

3088
01:48:12,780 --> 01:48:15,180
(What game has them so hooked?)

3089
01:48:15,260 --> 01:48:16,740
Ocean Hide-and-Seek!

3090
01:48:16,740 --> 01:48:19,110
(Bonus episode preview)

3091
01:48:19,110 --> 01:48:21,190
(Ocean Hide-and-Seek)

3092
01:48:21,240 --> 01:48:22,520
Let's give a cheer.

3093
01:48:22,520 --> 01:48:23,160
Come on! Let's go!

3094
01:48:23,160 --> 01:48:23,960
(Suddenly fired up)
Here we go!

3095
01:48:24,120 --> 01:48:24,760
One, two, three.

3096
01:48:24,760 --> 01:48:25,840
Let's go!

3097
01:48:25,920 --> 01:48:26,530
First word.

3098
01:48:27,100 --> 01:48:27,720
Fan!

3099
01:48:27,720 --> 01:48:28,240
Slap!

3100
01:48:28,240 --> 01:48:29,340
(Call it!*1)

3101
01:48:29,440 --> 01:48:29,890
Bing!

3102
01:48:30,260 --> 01:48:31,400
(Did they figure it out?)

3103
01:48:31,400 --> 01:48:32,880
Wang Anyu, say something!

3104
01:48:32,880 --> 01:48:33,760
I did.

3105
01:48:33,760 --> 01:48:35,300
I was the first to call out Bing.

3106
01:48:36,460 --> 01:48:37,200
(You)

3107
01:48:37,200 --> 01:48:39,000
See? I told you!

3108
01:48:39,080 --> 01:48:41,520
(Blaming him already)
Why'd you have to be so bold?

3109
01:48:41,600 --> 01:48:44,020
I told you not to show off!

3110
01:48:48,220 --> 01:48:49,140
(Call it!*2)

3111
01:48:49,800 --> 01:48:50,760
What happened?

3112
01:48:50,840 --> 01:48:51,520
What's going on?

3113
01:48:51,520 --> 01:48:52,320
Wang Churan.

3114
01:48:52,560 --> 01:48:53,560
What?

3115
01:48:53,560 --> 01:48:54,400
(Fired up)
Let's bet!

3116
01:48:54,640 --> 01:48:55,200
(Fired up)
Bet!

3117
01:48:55,200 --> 01:48:55,720
Bet!

3118
01:48:55,880 --> 01:48:56,960
(Pleading)
Or maybe you could

3119
01:48:56,960 --> 01:48:58,760
give me another chance to act it out?

3120
01:48:58,840 --> 01:49:00,240
Go ahead, keep acting.

3121
01:49:00,240 --> 01:49:01,870
But we've already made our guess.

3122
01:49:03,520 --> 01:49:04,540
(In disbelief)
Wrong?

3123
01:49:04,560 --> 01:49:05,530
First word.

3124
01:49:06,560 --> 01:49:07,490
And the second...

3125
01:49:08,320 --> 01:49:09,440
(Call it!*3)
I'm calling it. Huang Jingyu.

3126
01:49:09,680 --> 01:49:12,040
(Fired up)
Let's bet!

3127
01:49:12,040 --> 01:49:12,600
We're betting!

3128
01:49:12,600 --> 01:49:13,040
Bet!

3129
01:49:15,100 --> 01:49:16,940
(Who's the real master of disguise?)

3130
